Fixed: IBTK::CCPoissonHypreLevelSolver now gives hypre the periodic shift of the domain only for a level that has cells at both ends of the domain, as IBTK::SCPoissonHypreLevelSolver does, through the new IBTK::get_hypre_periodic_shift(). With the shift, the SMG solver could fail to converge on a level that reaches only one end of a periodic domain whose period on that level is not a power of two. The solver also writes to plog at the start of each solve if enable_logging is set.
